
# Date and time.

load @cluesurf/base/code/mixin/each
  find define-each

host interval
  term year
  term month
  term day
  term hour
  term minute
  term second

tree interval-accessor
  take name

  hook bind
    task get-{name}
      like integer

    task set-{name}
      take value, like integer

    task add-{name}s
      take value, like integer

form date
  link year, like integer
  link month, like integer
  link day, like integer
  link hour, like integer
  link minute, like integer
  link second, like integer

  fuse define-each, read interval
    read interval-accessor

task now
  like date
